' An ordinary new game that can be watched for a month.
'
' The player hires one man, leaves his own knife on a room floor at Bearwoods
' so the place makes something, and leaves the man holding it. After that he
' lives the way a player lives: every three days he walks in, takes the maggot
' the camp has made - a maggot is three days' food, and three days cost three
' - and drinks at the spring, which refills every morning. Nothing is switched off and nothing is
' edited; this is the upkeep the game already has.
'
' Holding one place is also what frees the opponent's second camp: it will not
' get more than one ahead of a human.
menuclick 160,100        ' the intro: a click goes to the start screen (IntroScene.cs:135-139)
menuclick 60,104         ' player one's slot opens: face 0, and Max for a name
menuclick 161,165        ' the rules toggle opens on extended; like the original
menuclick 163,54         ' START
mapclick 75,303          ' into New Sandez
clickon 248
hire
wait 20
esc
mapclick 61,355          ' sets out; the days on the road pass by themselves (v0.9.1 skips a travelling player's turns)
mapclick 61,355          ' walk in
wait 60
mapclick 402,230         ' a room to leave the knife in
wait 40
uiclick 132,211           ' the bottle goes down first
wait 5
uiclick 132,211           ' and the knife after it: the camp has a tool now
wait 5
uiclick 292,128          ' the bottle comes back
wait 5
esc
wait 20
esc
join                     ' he stays: Bearwoods is ours
day
day
day
mapclick 61,355          ' walk in for what the camp has made
wait 40
mapclick 436,200         ' the room the produce lands in
wait 30
uiclick 328,128
wait 5
esc
wait 15
mapclick 500,233         ' and the spring
wait 20
esc
wait 10
esc
